3. AWS-native tools available for image creation

This is one of the most important sections of your research.

You should compare the available approaches, not just mention Image Builder.

Tool 1 — EC2 Image Builder ⭐

This should probably be your primary recommendation.

AWS Image Builder allows you to automate:

Base AMI
   ↓
Components
   ↓
Build
   ↓
Test
   ↓
AMI
   ↓
Distribution

AWS explicitly provides build, test and distribution workflows. The build stage creates the image, the test stage launches an instance from that image and tests it, and distribution copies the resulting image to target Regions/accounts.

